control: Only the roles that call a provider read oauth_clients and their own account's state, and the UI reads its account's progress and never a credential
removes: the roles of the job kinds that reach credentials through the worker's execution context, backfill's and reorg apply and rollback's, keep the read and write of a sealed credential and the read of the OAuth clients
packages: ./db/check
tests: TestTheProviderCallingRolesReadTheirAccountsState/mediated_mailbox_backfill/reads_a_credential TestTheProviderCallingRolesReadTheirAccountsState/mediated_mailbox_backfill/updates_a_credential TestTheProviderCallingRolesReadTheirAccountsState/mediated_mailbox_organize/reads_a_credential TestTheProviderCallingRolesReadTheirAccountsState/mediated_mailbox_organize/updates_a_credential TestOnlyTheProviderCallingRolesReadTheOAuthClients/mediated_mailbox_backfill/reads_a_client TestOnlyTheProviderCallingRolesReadTheOAuthClients/mediated_mailbox_organize/reads_a_client
scheduled-count: no
integration: yes

